{* Unified highlight of a file number (spisovka): a primary-tinted chip with
   a border. The font intentionally inherits from the surroundings (no mono,
   no size change) and the padding is em-based so the chip scales from H1
   headings down to small muted lines. Pass `href` to make the number a link
   (rendered inside the box); the copy-to-clipboard button always sits after
   it (assets/copy-button.js swaps the icon to a check on success).
   Usage: {include spisovka from '../@spisovka.latte', label: $label, href: $url} *}

{* A referenced case, rendered by the rule we apply everywhere: link to its
   detail when we know the court, otherwise - as long as the file number looks
   like a court case at all - offer it prefilled on the homepage search. A
   reference that is not a court case (a prosecutor file) gets no link.
   Expects an item built by SpisPresenter::caseChip().
   Usage: {include case-chip from '../@spisovka.latte', case: $item, withCourt: true} *}
{define case-chip, array $case, bool $withCourt = false}
    {include spisovka, label: $case['label'], href: $case['linkable']
        ? $presenter->link(':Spis:detail', ['soud' => $case['courtSlug'], 'znacka' => $case['slug']])
        : ($case['search'] !== null ? $presenter->link(':Home:default', ['znacka' => $case['search']]) : null)}
    {if $withCourt && ($case['courtName'] ?? null) !== null} · {$case['courtName']}{/if}
{/define}

{define spisovka, string $label, ?string $href = null}
    <span class="whitespace-nowrap rounded-[0.4em] border border-primary/40 bg-primary/10 px-[0.35em] py-[0.1em] text-primary">
        {if $href !== null}<a href="{$href}" class="link-hover">{$label}</a>{else}{$label}{/if}<button
            type="button" data-copy="{$label}" title="Zkopírovat spisovou značku" aria-label="Zkopírovat spisovou značku"
            class="ml-[0.35em] cursor-pointer opacity-60 hover:opacity-100"
            ><span class="icon-[material-symbols-light--content-copy-outline] align-[-0.125em]" aria-hidden="true"></span
            ><span class="icon-[material-symbols-light--check] align-[-0.125em] hidden" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
    </span>
{/define}
